---
import { Picture } from 'astro:assets';
import profile from '../../assets/profile.png';
---

<section class="about">
	<div class="about__container">
		<h2 class="about__title">Hi, I’m Theo</h2>
		<div class="about__content">
			<div class="about__author">
				<Picture
					src={profile}
					formats={['avif', 'webp', 'jpg']}
					width="160"
					height="160"
					alt=""
					class="coming-soon"
				/>
				<div class="author__info">
					<p class="author__name">Theo Soti</p>
					<p class="author__title">Web designer & front-end developer</p>
				</div>
			</div>

			<p class="about__description">
				For the past eight years, I’ve helped teams design and build fast, responsive interfaces with modern CSS.
				<br />
				I also started sharing the techniques I use in real projects. Today, that work reaches:
			</p>
			<ul class="about__description">
				<li>23,000+ developers on LinkedIn</li>
				<li>9 million impressions in a year</li>
				<li>3,000 newsletter subscribers</li>
			</ul>
			<p class="about__description">
				I wrote <i>You Don’t Need JavaScript</i> to put the most useful of those techniques in one practical guide. It
				focuses on real interface patterns you can build with HTML and CSS before reaching for JavaScript.
			</p>
		</div>
	</div>
	<div class="about__background"></div>
</section>
